<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training, expanding their capabilities, and navy marines and other units have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in Lake Chad. The military chief held high-level talks with Rwanda Defence Force leadership, discussing cooperation while fresh France-Chad ties were noted. Sudanese Arab refugees fleeing to Chad are encountering hostility and distrust from local populations near the CAR border, and a man deported from Minnesota to CAR reports his life is at high risk. The conflict recorded 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQTTctQUwyTnBNUDg0ZTlzV3ZRMWJrS1ZjeDBxbVkydmtiazF5ZEMwZWJJR1FQU19RX1RjUzVXS0hJdWRSeUpQVHY2YXVfTlZxVWRRNGN3b183dFZxZXV2RmJaem1sQmZDZ1hxVlZoM1o1YnpaSjJqckhEeU4yUEtVQVgzRUcxY0xiSW05eS1Wdl9CaXYyUmRuRzVlYTJUMklYcExHMVdfRjlLRjBwT1NQMjdRTmt0NDlo?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPcFlLSHpRcG05Y3VMRHhyR1djMmY1RVlhM3RSejd2WVpZNzhXOWE3M285SGxoeVI1VE1TQ2FtQjY5eXZWVmdiVUZibTVKVFdPWUJ5NlNoeEkxNzk3NEhDaWVKYUt0T2tVSEh5TkVmS0Z0bklKRFdYSWRUa3lnSXkwZmFlZzZWMVBCR1cxcU1oRzdRTjFMR0tIS29GLTJWUkI4RHFndXNpOGlKTFJnSERhOGhmaG40Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPbHpSRHI0emQyd29HY29QejZxamp4dW55LU1sNVY2YUZCMVpwUzJsQk15ZlI0b2dwdzBVWmQyN3BqT3dBdHJ0S29BU2duRHRWSWtoUmxBTW5jemY2UjNLZ0tlT21lSEw4MzUwakpfS29UckpWUkFSRzl3V044c3NRdW94TkF5NER1VE1yb3k0RVpQZkFKNTBJS0ZKUkx6clpDZUwyaUxHYmxKUXpkd3gyRTJVOVhqcXhobzJJVGFkbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOX0xDZFVwNVFNRXlGNG9zcEVHUk8wTXhrU0ozcVRiTVROd1dSNFNMWE1HeG14SDlGS3hsOFU5Y05hMDBsSV9WQUN5VUo2Q2tYMmg2NHd